eenshot_placeholder": "Screenshot: New report with data area selection"}, {"order": 3, "title": "Drag Required Fields", "content": "Drag these fields to your report:\n- Student ID, First Name, Last Name\n- Incident Number, Start Date, Days Assigned\n- Offense Code, Home Campus", "screenshot_url": null, "screenshot_placeholder": "Screenshot: Drag-and-drop field builder"}, {"order": 4, "title": "Apply Filters", "content": "Filter to show only DAEP placements for your date range.", "screenshot_url": null, "screenshot_placeholder": "Screenshot: Filter configuration"}, {"order": 5, "title": "Export to CSV", "content": "Click **Export** and select CSV format.", "screenshot_url": null, "screenshot_placeholder": "Screenshot: Export options"} ]'::jsonb);

